{"id":"n72135-1-12","stage":3,"title":"추위 · 寒冷","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72135-1-12-1","ko":"봄이 오려는지 퍽 따뜻해졌군요.","zh":"看来春天要来了，天气变得相当暖和呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"봄이","meaning":"春，春天，春季","explanation":"봄：春，春天，春季；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"봄","audio":"/audio/c3756af91340d5ce8345.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20219","senseId":"1","lemma":"봄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오려는지","meaning":"到；表示实现前面动作的想法。","explanation":"오다：到；하다：表示实现前面动作的想法。；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"19","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"퍽","meaning":"砰","explanation":"퍽：砰","readings":[{"term":"퍽","audio":"/audio/eac7ae59cf75b1a24fc4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80315","senseId":"5","lemma":"퍽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"따뜻해졌군요.","meaning":"暖和；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"따뜻하다：暖和；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"따뜻하다","audio":"/audio/e4840ad0903352f1e2e3.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57297","senseId":"1","lemma":"따뜻하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c3756af91340d5ce","term":"봄","zh":"春，春天，春季","audio":"/audio/c3756af91340d5ce8345.mp3","entryId":"20219","definition":"四季之一，在冬天与夏天之间。","pronunciation":["봄"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"某个时间或季节等来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"eac7ae59cf75b1a2","term":"퍽","zh":"砰","audio":"/audio/eac7ae59cf75b1a24fc4.mp3","entryId":"80315","definition":"不太强烈地爆裂的声音。","pronunciation":["퍽"]},{"id":"e4840ad0903352f1","term":"따뜻하다","zh":"暖和","audio":"/audio/e4840ad0903352f1e2e3.mp3","entryId":"57297","definition":"温度适中，不觉得太热，达到心情舒适的程度。","pronunciation":["따뜨타다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f0f70b5bb16d5748022c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72135-1-12-2","ko":"그러게요. 이제야 추위가 좀 풀려 가네요.","zh":"是啊，寒冷终于开始消退了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게요.","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이제야","meaning":"这才","explanation":"이제야：这才","readings":[{"term":"이제야","audio":"/audio/2be18ec567b0073f4c4c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24993","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제야","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"추위가","meaning":"寒冷，冷","explanation":"추위：寒冷，冷；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"추위","audio":"/audio/bd2cd1495e00ab524a5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72135","senseId":"1","lemma":"추위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"풀려","meaning":"回暖，融化","explanation":"풀리다：回暖，融化；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"풀리다","audio":"/audio/aba31e511b1563e0e599.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62314","senseId":"12","lemma":"풀리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가네요.","meaning":"过","explanation":"가다：过；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"27","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"87d7b69edce28452","term":"그러게","zh":"就是嘛，可不嘛","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3","entryId":"36269","definition":"用于赞成或同意对方所说的话。","pronunciation":["그러게"]},{"id":"2be18ec567b0073f","term":"이제야","zh":"这才","audio":"/audio/2be18ec567b0073f4c4c.mp3","entryId":"24993","definition":"说话的当时才。","pronunciation":["이제야"]},{"id":"bd2cd1495e00ab52","term":"추위","zh":"寒冷，冷","audio":"/audio/bd2cd1495e00ab524a5e.mp3","entryId":"72135","definition":"主要指冬季的寒气或冷天气。","pronunciation":["추위"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"aba31e511b1563e0","term":"풀리다","zh":"回暖，融化","audio":"/audio/aba31e511b1563e0e599.mp3","entryId":"62314","definition":"冰块化掉或寒冷的天气变暖。","pronunciation":["풀리다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"过","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"时间经过或消逝。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8f97aad80ef9ce6eda85.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.162,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72135","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":104,"sequenceScore":2.7596,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["看来春天要来了，天气变得相当暖和呢。","是啊，寒冷终于开始消退了。","您好像经常去那家餐厅呢。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["看来春天要来了，天气变得相当暖和呢。","是啊，寒冷终于开始消退了。","您好像经常去那家餐厅呢。"],"answer":1}]}
